WEBVTT

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:05.110
We can't be together anymore.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:11.980
Wait, Shione!

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:13.860
Why not?!

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:19.200
Let's all work together! It'll be just like old times!

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:21.990
We'll all be waiting for you!

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:25.210
If all five of us work together, I know it'll turn out great!

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:32.460
I'll be waiting...

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:09.360
Nonoka, did something happen between you and Shione?

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:14.820
I thought we became friends again yesterday...

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:19.750
She said we would do it together...

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:23.210
Is Togawa still giving you a hard time?

00:02:23.630 --> 00:02:26.780
No, it's my fault.

00:02:26.780 --> 00:02:27.960
I...

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:29.610
What do you mean, it's your fault?

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:31.400
Shione's just being shy.

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:32.450
Yuzuki!

00:02:32.450 --> 00:02:36.280
I bet she actually wants to be here with us,
she just doesn't want to admit it!

00:02:36.280 --> 00:02:39.110
Stop making things up like that.

00:02:39.110 --> 00:02:41.100
But I asked her myself!

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:48.460
I asked, "Do you like Nonoka or not?!"

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:51.710
What, just like that?

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:57.290
And... how did Shione reply?

00:02:57.930 --> 00:03:01.530
"That's obvious, isn't it?"

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:05.040
So chin up, Nonoka!

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:07.520
All right, thanks.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:12.930
Everything will be okay. I believe in Shione.

00:03:23.950 --> 00:03:24.700
Noel.

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:27.440
Oh, Shione!

00:03:27.820 --> 00:03:30.770
Huh? You're not with Nonoka?

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:33.870
Noel, I need to ask you something.

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:37.700
What is it, Shione?

00:03:38.330 --> 00:03:42.200
What will happen to the Disc once you grant us our wishes?

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:47.100
After it grants someone's wish,
it can be called by someone else to fulfill their own!

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:49.960
It's just like how everyone called it back then!

00:03:51.770 --> 00:03:52.850
But then—

00:03:53.550 --> 00:03:57.970
"Mr. Disc, Mr. Disc, please!"

00:03:58.450 --> 00:04:01.830
"Please make my wish come true."

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:06.850
Yours and Nonoka's wishes will be realized soon!

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:08.730
Okay?

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:10.220
Huh?

00:04:14.490 --> 00:04:17.740
Oh? Are you leaving already?

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:21.560
Noel will be coming to see your planetarium, okay?

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:31.300
Nonoka!

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:33.130
Noel...

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:35.130
Nonoka!

00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:38.870
Give Noel your ticket!

00:04:40.470 --> 00:04:42.900
But what about the Disc?

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:44.640
It's all okay now!

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:48.020
With these, Noel can go see the planetarium!

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:49.550
Noel...

00:04:49.550 --> 00:04:50.740
You even have Shione's...

00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:55.030
Now everyone's happy together!

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:57.530
Thank you, Noel.

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:19.100
I was thinking of going to the festival on Sunday.

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:20.360
How is your booth coming along?

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:22.220
We're a bit behind schedule.

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:24.700
We'll have to wrap it up in these next three days.

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:29.210
C'mon, eat up!

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:30.330
All right then.

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:33.940
Thank you for the food.

00:05:34.740 --> 00:05:36.440
Good morning, Nonoka.

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:37.850
Good morning...

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:39.280
Wait, what?

00:05:40.030 --> 00:05:41.410
Why is everyone here?

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:43.660
Koharu begged us for help.

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:46.520
She was all, "We won't finish in time without you!"

00:05:46.520 --> 00:05:49.260
What? I thought you were in this for those buns!

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:52.480
We <i>are</i> pretty understaffed, after all.

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:55.080
You should'a asked us earlier, man!

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:57.630
There's no way you'd finish this with only four people!

00:05:58.280 --> 00:06:00.420
We should make it now though, right?

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:02.640
Hey, why aren't <i>you</i> helping?

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:06.500
If I'm too busy to delegate the work,
people won't know what needs to be done!

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:07.940
Excuse me?

00:06:07.940 --> 00:06:10.530
Everyone's been working just fine
without you to boss them around!

00:06:10.530 --> 00:06:11.640
C'mon, get to work!

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:13.620
Who's the one bossing people around <i>now</i>?!

00:06:13.620 --> 00:06:14.030
You were never a competent leader so you wouldn't know anything, Souta!

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:17.080
Nonoka, I'm sure that Shione will...

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:17.500
I know she will, Koharu!

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:19.010
Like you're one to talk!

00:06:19.010 --> 00:06:19.340
Everyone's doing just fine!

00:06:19.340 --> 00:06:20.780
She'll come for sure!

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:25.790
She even gave Noel her ticket to the festival, just like the rest of us!

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:28.830
I know she'll come.

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:32.710
I just know it!

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:36.610
Let's make this happen together!

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:38.460
Yeah!

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:42.210
Yes. Right.

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:45.470
No, not really.

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:49.030
It's nothing that you'd be worried about, Father.

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:53.350
But... I'd prefer if I could leave as soon as I can.

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:55.620
Sorry.

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:58.580
I know I said that I'd stay here by myself.

00:07:00.530 --> 00:07:01.780
Snow?

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:04.440
It already snowed.

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:54.950
Tomorrow's the day, huh?

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:56.860
It all went by in a flash.

00:07:57.600 --> 00:08:00.500
Shione will come... won't she?

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:02.480
Of course she will!

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:04.250
There's no doubt about it.

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:08.010
And when she does, it'll be just like old times.

00:08:08.010 --> 00:08:12.400
We can kick off the whole thing with your buns, Koharu!

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:13.670
Calm down.

00:08:20.940 --> 00:08:23.700
Close your door. I can see everything.

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:26.280
Souta, come in here and check these out!

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:28.280
What's up?

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:32.680
Well?

00:08:33.790 --> 00:08:35.050
What?

00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:38.500
No, I was just thinking that you can finally put those hobbies of yours to good use.

00:08:39.380 --> 00:08:41.000
They're not "hobbies!"

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:57.480
Everyone who's been helping will be there, so we're going to need all of these!

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:16.140
Nonoka, do you believe me?

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:22.500
No one else would take what I said about the book seriously.

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:24.570
But you do, don't you Shione?

00:09:25.340 --> 00:09:26.460
Yes.

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:28.380
Then so do I!

00:09:30.330 --> 00:09:32.860
Thank you, Nonoka!

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:37.600
It's not just the two of us either.

00:09:39.900 --> 00:09:41.980
What're you two gossiping about?

00:09:44.740 --> 00:09:46.480
I want to ask everyone for something!

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:48.860
Let's call the Disc together!

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:51.050
"Disc?"

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:55.040
It sounds like fun!

00:09:56.060 --> 00:09:57.710
A disc, huh?

00:09:57.710 --> 00:09:59.720
It'd really be something if one actually came!

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:01.750
I bet we'd all be shocked!

00:10:02.180 --> 00:10:04.250
We might even be on T.V!

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:06.310
That'd be sweet!

00:10:06.310 --> 00:10:07.090
What if we become famous?
See?

00:10:07.090 --> 00:10:09.670
What if we become famous?

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:11.020
As if.

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:29.690
Koharu, Yuzuki, and Souta are all happy.

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:32.450
Shione is happy too!

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:34.760
This is what everyone wished for!

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:44.750
This is all we have to do?

00:10:44.750 --> 00:10:47.100
There's nothing to it. This is boring!

00:10:48.630 --> 00:10:51.780
There's one more thing we're missing.

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:57.640
We need to think of a wish while we call the Disc.

00:10:57.640 --> 00:10:58.760
A wish?

00:10:59.160 --> 00:11:04.770
Those strong feelings will call the Disc.

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:08.430
So we need to have a wish in our head?

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:12.030
Is the Disc going to make it come true?

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:14.430
Well, I don't know about that...

00:11:14.430 --> 00:11:16.830
What if we have lots of wishes?

00:11:16.830 --> 00:11:18.460
Then pick one.

00:11:18.460 --> 00:11:21.440
What? That's not fair, Onii-chan.

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:22.940
What about you, Nonoka?

00:11:22.940 --> 00:11:24.040
Me?

00:11:24.650 --> 00:11:27.220
I've already decided.

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:28.740
What kind of wish is it?

00:11:28.740 --> 00:11:29.540
It's a secret.

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:34.330
I mean, if you tell someone what you wish for, it might not come true.

00:11:35.010 --> 00:11:36.720
I don't want that to happen!

00:11:43.230 --> 00:11:47.600
Mr. Disc, Mr. Disc, please!

00:11:48.530 --> 00:11:51.220
Please make my wish come true.

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:58.870
Good morning, Nonoka.

00:11:58.870 --> 00:11:59.970
Good morning!

00:12:03.090 --> 00:12:04.530
Nice timing.

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:13.380
Wait! There's still...

00:12:13.740 --> 00:12:14.920
Noel-chan?

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:16.920
I promised to meet her here.

00:12:17.530 --> 00:12:19.180
Nonoka!

00:12:20.230 --> 00:12:21.680
Nonoka!

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:35.670
I'll take this and walk around the grounds too.

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:38.670
Let's go, Noel.

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:39.670
Yup!

00:13:43.540 --> 00:13:46.180
It all smells so delicious!

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:48.310
Would you like to try something?

00:13:48.740 --> 00:13:49.810
Can I?

00:13:50.110 --> 00:13:52.060
Sure. What would you like?

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:54.310
Um...

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:56.320
That!

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:05.100
It's yummy!

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:07.270
Do you like it?

00:14:07.270 --> 00:14:08.080
Yup!

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:14.440
Yum!

00:14:14.440 --> 00:14:15.410
You should try this.

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:27.890
It's sweet!

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:29.090
Huh?

00:14:31.290 --> 00:14:33.680
Oops, this has red bean in it.

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:36.870
It's sweet, but it's soft and fluffy and nice!

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:39.360
That's good.

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:43.360
Nonoka, where's Shione?

00:14:43.840 --> 00:14:46.000
She should be here...

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:49.990
Maybe she's already at the planetarium.

00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:55.490
Okay!

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:58.380
Thanks for the food!

00:14:58.730 --> 00:15:00.880
The planetarium is this way!

00:15:01.520 --> 00:15:02.880
Welcome!

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:05.440
Please take your time.

00:15:05.440 --> 00:15:07.360
Hey, is Shione here?

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:09.380
No, not yet...

00:15:09.900 --> 00:15:11.070
I see.

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:12.810
Hey, come on.

00:15:12.810 --> 00:15:15.990
The festival's only just begun!

00:15:15.990 --> 00:15:17.310
She'll come sooner or later.

00:15:18.050 --> 00:15:19.020
Right.

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:20.550
Komiya, you're here now.

00:15:20.550 --> 00:15:21.540
Nice timing.

00:15:22.490 --> 00:15:24.570
I asked the teacher just now,

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:26.400
and apparently Togawa was marked absent today.

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:27.460
Huh?

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:28.990
Wait here, Noel.

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:31.950
Wait, Nonoka!

00:15:32.350 --> 00:15:33.950
I'm going to drop by her house!

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:36.760
What? Do you even know where she lives?

00:15:36.760 --> 00:15:37.880
Hey!

00:15:38.360 --> 00:15:39.690
Hey, c'mon...

00:15:40.680 --> 00:15:43.340
We'll be fine here, so you should go with her!

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:49.000
Noel-chan,

00:15:50.180 --> 00:15:53.600
would you like to see the planetarium while you wait for Nonoka to come back?

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:56.310
Noel wants to see it with everyone.

00:15:57.010 --> 00:16:00.560
Don't you worry. We'll all be here soon.

00:16:01.180 --> 00:16:02.870
Just wait a little longer, okay?

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:09.000
Hey, Nonoka.

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:10.350
I need to leave for a bit!

00:16:10.350 --> 00:16:12.410
Hey! Where are you off to?

00:16:12.410 --> 00:16:14.430
To a friend's place!

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:28.800
Where's Nonoka?

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:35.080
I couldn't keep up with her.

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:40.310
That's because you were lugging that thing around with you.

00:16:40.870 --> 00:16:43.820
I'll text her Togawa's address.

00:16:48.510 --> 00:16:51.400
Huh? Where do I need to go from here?

00:16:54.680 --> 00:16:55.450
Shione!

00:16:58.220 --> 00:17:00.540
W-Wait!

00:17:03.850 --> 00:17:05.340
Welcome!

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:10.890
Nonoka, where are you right now?

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:13.390
I caught a glimpse of her earlier, but...

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:15.300
Yeah.

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:17.890
Okay, I'm going to keep looking for her.

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:33.690
There you are.

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:38.410
Nonoka?

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:50.090
I thought I made it clear that I didn't want you around me anymore.

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:52.510
Why aren't you coming to the Hokubi Festival?

00:17:52.510 --> 00:17:54.480
We're all waiting for you.

00:17:54.480 --> 00:17:56.230
Didn't you hear what I said?

00:17:56.230 --> 00:17:58.570
Or did you just not get it?

00:17:59.170 --> 00:18:02.050
I don't like being with you guys.

00:18:02.860 --> 00:18:06.110
Are you staying away from us
because you can't forgive me?

00:18:06.860 --> 00:18:13.090
After seven years, I know it's unfair of me to expect your forgiveness.

00:18:13.090 --> 00:18:15.990
But Shione, I really—

00:18:16.410 --> 00:18:17.770
How stupid are you?

00:18:17.770 --> 00:18:19.200
I already told you.

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:21.690
I don't want to listen to you anymore.

00:18:21.690 --> 00:18:24.380
Don't waste your breath any longer.

00:18:25.140 --> 00:18:26.650
Noel's waiting for you too.

00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:31.940
You gave her your ticket, so that means you wanted to come and see it, right?

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:33.700
Am I wrong?

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:39.520
I want to see the planetarium—

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:42.770
the meteor shower, with everyone!

00:18:43.400 --> 00:18:46.030
I want to play together like when we were kids,

00:18:46.030 --> 00:18:49.320
talk, and laugh together!

00:18:49.320 --> 00:18:50.780
Shione!

00:18:58.940 --> 00:19:00.240
Did you forget what I said?

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:02.290
I'll say it again then.

00:19:03.430 --> 00:19:06.170
Don't call out my name like we're actually friends.

00:19:06.820 --> 00:19:07.630
If you do—

00:19:07.630 --> 00:19:08.750
Shione!

00:19:14.240 --> 00:19:17.200
I don't want to call you "Togawa-san."

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:19.930
We <i>are</i> friends, aren't we?!

00:19:24.060 --> 00:19:27.440
I hate you.

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:30.690
I don't want to see, or hear you!

00:19:31.220 --> 00:19:33.440
We're not friends at all!

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:37.110
There's no way we can both be happy.

00:19:38.210 --> 00:19:39.530
We can't!

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:41.690
Noel will...

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:53.750
I'm different from you.

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:55.850
If I don't make promises I can't keep,

00:19:56.460 --> 00:19:58.800
then no one will expect anything from me.

00:20:00.460 --> 00:20:03.120
Goodbye, Komiya-san.

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:27.400
I wonder if Nonoka found Shione...

00:20:27.900 --> 00:20:31.850
Man, there's no point to this if all five of us aren't here together!

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:33.920
We're here to help with the tear-down!

00:20:34.300 --> 00:20:37.230
Thanks, but we'll take care of it ourselves.

00:20:37.230 --> 00:20:39.800
You can leave packing up to us.

00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:41.800
Are you sure?

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:44.740
Sorry. You guys came all the way here to help, but...

00:20:44.740 --> 00:20:46.310
No worries...

00:20:51.370 --> 00:20:53.870
We still haven't given up.

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:55.820
No, we haven't.

00:20:57.790 --> 00:20:59.700
Wait, where's Noel?

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:03.080
Huh? She was sitting right there just a second ago.

00:21:03.600 --> 00:21:05.370
What if she went after Nonoka?

00:21:05.370 --> 00:21:06.970
I'm going to go look for her!

00:21:06.970 --> 00:21:08.760
Hey, wait!

00:21:34.160 --> 00:21:35.240
Noel?!

00:21:39.830 --> 00:21:40.950
Noel!

00:21:43.220 --> 00:21:44.260
Nonoka...

00:21:47.730 --> 00:21:48.830
Noel!

00:23:32.380 --> 00:23:34.730
Next time, on Sora no Method:

00:23:34.730 --> 00:23:36.150
"Where the Wish Went."

00:23:36.150 --> 00:23:37.520
Look forward to it!
